{"4433320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trinkets and Gunpowder", "steam_appid": 4433320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/10462a79c07ef77c49b30418f3b77946.avif?t=1774629073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras_big/10462a79c07ef77c49b30418f3b77946.avif?t=1774629073 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets and Gunpowder is a tense game of reactions and strategy. You both have the same randomised lineup of items in your guns, and you will both be shown what is in the current chamber at the same random time, but after that it's up to whoever can react first. Shoot yourself while the current chamber has a powerup card and you will gain that card, which you can play to gain an advantage when you feel the time is right. But in both guns is a single bullet, and whoever gets shot by a bullet, either from their opponent or themselves, loses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/599cd9c0237da87d6feb7771871012f1.avif?t=1774629073\" width=807 height=607 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use any combination of items at your disposal, creating an infinite amount of possibilities for how to give yourself as much as an advantage going into the next draw as possible. Use the Spyglass to check if the next round is lethal, then the Watch to learn exactly when you need to pull the trigger. Or use the Arrow to skip over the bullet then swap your guns to put your opponent in a weaker position. Keeping track of as much information as possible is key to effective play. But at the end of the day, it all comes down to who can shoot first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/9928e275489fc08bdc5807f605c7d545.avif?t=1774629073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras_big/9928e275489fc08bdc5807f605c7d545.avif?t=1774629073 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard Offline Match: With customisable AI difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless: Achieve the highest score possible before losing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Match: Play against your friends or randoms online</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/10462a79c07ef77c49b30418f3b77946.avif?t=1774629073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras_big/10462a79c07ef77c49b30418f3b77946.avif?t=1774629073 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets and Gunpowder is a tense game of reactions and strategy. You both have the same randomised lineup of items in your guns, and you will both be shown what is in the current chamber at the same random time, but after that it's up to whoever can react first. Shoot yourself while the current chamber has a powerup card and you will gain that card, which you can play to gain an advantage when you feel the time is right. But in both guns is a single bullet, and whoever gets shot by a bullet, either from their opponent or themselves, loses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/599cd9c0237da87d6feb7771871012f1.avif?t=1774629073\" width=807 height=607 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use any combination of items at your disposal, creating an infinite amount of possibilities for how to give yourself as much as an advantage going into the next draw as possible. Use the Spyglass to check if the next round is lethal, then the Watch to learn exactly when you need to pull the trigger. Or use the Arrow to skip over the bullet then swap your guns to put your opponent in a weaker position. Keeping track of as much information as possible is key to effective play. But at the end of the day, it all comes down to who can shoot first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras/9928e275489fc08bdc5807f605c7d545.avif?t=1774629073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433320/extras_big/9928e275489fc08bdc5807f605c7d545.avif?t=1774629073 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard Offline Match: With customisable AI difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless: Achieve the highest score possible before losing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Match: Play against your friends or randoms online</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Trinkets and Gunpowder is an exciting Russian Roulette inspired party game. React quickly to gain cards which can offer various strategic advantages, but take too long to pull the trigger and your opponent may get there first.", "supported_languages": "Engli